  "explanation": "The question asks when the Dallas County Courthouse was built. The original sources provide conflicting dates depending on which courthouse is being referenced:\n\n1. **1902** is cited in D1S1 and D3S5 as the year the *current* Dallas County Courthouse in Adel, Iowa, was built.\n2. **1885** is mentioned in D4S1 and D4S4 as the construction year of an earlier courthouse in Adel, Iowa.\n3. **July 10, 1850**, from D5S2, refers to yet another courthouse, described as the \"present\" one at the time of writing, likely a prior iteration.\n\nEach of these dates corresponds to a distinct physical structure serving as a courthouse at different times. Since the question does not specify which courthouse, all three valid, distinct answers are preserved."
}
